## Example result categories

- Duplication Risk
  - Two work items are highly similar and likely represent overlapping effort.
- Collaboration Opportunity
  - Two work items are related enough to coordinate, but not clearly redundant.
- Low Concern
  - The work items are sufficiently different or weakly related.

## Future improvements

- Add support for more file formats
- Improve extraction quality for noisy or unstructured documents
- Replace or enhance AI explanations with a more configurable LLM workflow
- Add persistence and saved analyses
- Add user authentication and team-level dashboards
- Add visualization for similarity clusters and overlap trends

